            <div xml:id="d625">

                <pb facs="0605" n="593" xml:id="pg593"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1015/a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-08-31T20:00:00-04:00">August 31, 1939—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. For all Missions. Department is receiving requests from diplomatic
                    representatives of the other American republics for advice and assistance to
                    their nationals in Europe desirous of returning to this continent. Because of
                    the increasingly close and friendly relations maintained with the other American
                    governments, the Department is desirous of doing everything possible to be of
                    assistance to them and their citizens during the present situation and
                    accordingly will appreciate your cooperation with representatives and private
                    citizens of those countries who may apply to you, consistent of course with your
                    obligations to American nationals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
